ORGANIZER;CN=Events:mailto:cept.ac.in_cu2q4f7dpghaggll4k18s63puc@group.cale
 ndar.google.com
UID:vaf4jfm09e9on09njv4f820d70@google.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;CN=tu
 shar.bose@cept.ac.in;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:tushar.bose@cept.ac.in
CREATED:20160107T062349Z
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to attend the lecture by Christophe Jaffrelot o
 n The Gujarat Model Revisited on 15 January\, 2016 (Friday)\, organised und
 er the CEPT AU Lecture Series.\n\nLecture by:           CHRISTOPHE JAFFRELO
 T\n\nTitle:                     The Gujarat Model Revisited\n\nVenue:      
             Auditorium at CEPT University\n\n     Kasturbhai Lalbhai Campus
 \, Navrangpura\, Ahmedabad 380009\n\nDr. Christophe Jaffrelot is senior res
 earch fellow at CERI-Sciences Po/CNRS\, Professor of Indian Politics and So
 ciology at the King’s India Institute (London) and Global Scholar at Prince
 ton University. He has been visiting professor at Columbia University\, Yal
 e and SAIS (Johns Hopkins). He works at The Carnegie Endowment for Internat
 ional Peace as a Non Resident Scholar.\n\nAmong his publications are The Hi
 ndu nationalist movement and Indian politics\, 1925 to 1990s\, New Delhi\, 
 Penguin\, 1999\, India’s Silent Revolution. The Rise of the Lower Castes in
  North India\, New Delhi\, Permanent Black\, 2003\, Dr. Ambedkar and Untouc
 hability. Analysing and Fighting Caste\, New Delhi\, Permanent Black 2005 a
 nd The Pakistan Paradox. Instability and Resilience\, London/Hurst\, New Yo
 rk/OUP and New Delhi\, Random House\, 2015. He has also co-edited with Laur
 ent Gayer\, Muslims in Indian cities. Trajectories of marginalization\, New
  Delhi\, HarperCollins\, 2012.\n\nLectures under the CEPT AU Lecture Series
  are free and open for all.\n\nPlease find attached the poster for the same
 .\n\nWe look forward for your presence in the lecture.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160111T052612Z
LOCATION:Auditorium at CEPT University
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CEPT- AU Lecture Series: Christophe Jaffrelot on The Gujarat Model 
 Revisited 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
ATTACH;FILENAME=Christophe Jaffrelot vf (1).pdf:https://drive.google.com/a/
 cept.ac.in/file/d/0B1LlNybZk1tLVFFiMG5VWmgxaVk/view?usp=drive_web
END:VEVENT
