CREATED:20160107T060553Z
DESCRIPTION:A photograph always gives us a sense of reality\, but we all kn
 ow it's just that moment\, it may be hiding or not expressing the truth rig
 htfully. Let's try giving more life to the images by reinterpreting them or
  emphasising those emotions with this technique. People who enjoy doodling 
 on photographs will get a new tool in their arsenal. Just bring in a photog
 raph printed on a cartridge paper. \n\nPlease do register for the event at 
 bitly.com/FabFridayCEPT\nMaximum 20 entries allowed.\nOpen to all. Free adm
 ission
LAST-MODIFIED:20160107T060902Z
LOCATION:FabLab CEPT\, Ahmedabad
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:FabFriday_Picture Embroidery
