ORGANIZER;CN=chirayu.bhatt@cept.ac.in:mailto:chirayu.bhatt@cept.ac.in
UID:ddfuc3l8014m7l2drj3egcekkk@google.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=tushar
 .bose@cept.ac.in;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:tushar.bose@cept.ac.in
CREATED:20150911T140403Z
DESCRIPTION:Due to time conflicts\, we will need to do this meeting in two 
 parts - one next week\, where we will recap earlier conversation and articu
 late our expectations for the new website. Second part will be a follow up 
 discussion with timelines and costs\, in the week of 28th Sept. I hope that
  is convenient to all. \n\nDear All\,\n\nWe need to meet to plan out the de
 sign and implementation two new websites. \n1. Admissions Website\n2. Summe
 r Winter School Website\n\nWe have already had one discussion on this earli
 er but now we need to dust off the previous conversation and get started to
  work on this straight away. \n\nDear Amit\, \n\nCan we have an offline cha
 t to recap our earlier conversation. It would be great if you could bring s
 ome thoughts on timeline and cost when we meet on 23rd. We can have a chat 
 tomorrow (12th) or anytime next week (14-18). \n\nBest\,\nChirayu\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20150916T082118Z
LOCATION:FP213 - meeting room across Bimalbhai' office
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:New Websites - CEPT Admissions & SWS - pt 1
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
