CREATED:20140121T111642Z
DESCRIPTION:Agenda \n\n1.To inform the members about constitution of a comm
 ittee to review finances and project management of all projects under CRDC/
 CRDF and to resolve on actions to be taken. \n2.To inform the members about
  constitution of a committee to review the B. Plan program. \n3.To discuss 
 how the academic calendar can be modified to ensure greater focus on academ
 ic activities during monsoon & spring semesters.\n4.To inform members about
  recent developments regarding AICTE and to review CEPT University’s stand 
 on the matter of seeking AICTE approval for its programs. \n5.To review act
 ivities and initiatives of the Outreach Services. – Outreach Team\n6.To rev
 iew activities and initiatives of the Workshop team. – Jay Thakker & Sakthi
 vel Ramaswamy \n7.To review the feedback on Winter School. – Meghal Arya & 
 Manjiri Akalkotkar.\n8.To review the report on Students Feedback initiated 
 last semester. – Anu Sutaria & University Staff Office. \n9.Any other matte
 r with the permission of Chair.
